Template: hd-qemu-kvm/bridge-ports
Type: multiselect
Choices: ${choices}
Description: Wired interfaces to put in the bridge br0:
 Virtual machines reach the network through the bridge br0. The interfaces
 chosen here become its ports and lose their own addresses: br0 takes over the
 address settings of the first of them. More than one interface joins them in
 one network.
 .
 br0 has a MAC address of its own, so DHCP may give it another address than the
 interface had, and a connection over SSH may drop.
 .
 Choose none to set up the bridge later with hd-network-bridge and
 hd-network-iface.
